WEBVTT

00:07:57.755 --> 00:08:00.003
I have swum nine hours and 45 minutes ...

00:08:00.783 --> 00:08:01.958
exactly.

00:08:01.982 --> 00:08:04.379
(Laughter)

00:08:04.403 --> 00:08:06.355
And then there are the crises.

00:08:06.379 --> 00:08:07.529
Of course there are.

00:08:08.957 --> 00:08:12.275
And the vomiting starts,
the seawater -- you're not well.

00:08:12.299 --> 00:08:15.908
You're wearing a jellyfish mask
for the ultimate protection.

00:08:15.932 --> 00:08:17.391
It's difficult to swim in.

00:08:17.415 --> 00:08:20.049
It's causing abrasions
on the inside of the mouth,

00:08:20.073 --> 00:08:21.881
but the tentacles can't get you.

00:08:22.707 --> 00:08:25.268
And the hypothermia sets in.

00:08:25.292 --> 00:08:28.677
The water's 85 degrees,
and yet you're losing weight

00:08:28.701 --> 00:08:30.020
and using calories.